note Exercism-style exercise "sum-of-multiples": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/sum-of-multiples
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note sum is the sum of every distinct number below limit that is a multiple of at least one of the
note factors fs (a factor 0 has no multiples here).
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/sum-of-multiples
om2
fn sum fs view ulong * limit ulong to ulong
t = ulong 0
for m ulong limit
hit = false
for j ulong len fs
f = get fs j
if ne f 0
if eq rem m f 0
hit = true
end
end
end
if and hit ne m 0
t = add t m
end
end
ret t
end
